      "extracted_at": "2026-08-10T13:28:57Z",
      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "The company estimates its average worldwide oil-equivalent production in 2025 to increase six to eight percent over 2024, assuming a Brent crude oil price of $70 per barrel and excluding the impact of asset sales.",
            "entity_name": "CVX 2025 Worldwide Oil-Equivalent Production Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "As one of the largest producers in the Permian Basin, Chevron continues to develop its advantaged portfolio of 1,780,000 net acres in the Delaware and Midland basins in west Texas and southeast New Mexico and is expected to achieve one million barrels of net oil-equivalent production per day in 2025.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Permian Basin 2025 One Million BOE/d Production Target",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In December 2024, the company sold its 20 percent nonoperated working interest in the Athabasca Oil Sands Project and associated Quest carbon capture and storage project in Alberta, as well as its operated assets in the Duvernay shale.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Divestiture of Athabasca Oil Sands Project and Duvernay Assets",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Chevron withdrew from Myanmar, effective April 2024.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Withdrawal from Myanmar",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In January 2025, the company sold its interest in the ROC portion of Lianzi, while retaining the Angolan portion.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Sale of Republic of Congo Lianzi Interest",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In January 2025, the company sold its 31.5 percent nonoperated interest in the offshore Haute Mer permit area.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Sale of Haute Mer Permit Area",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In 2024, the company agreed to an asset swap of its 16.7 percent interest in the NWS Project, NWS Oil Project and its 20 percent interest in Angel Carbon Capture and Storage Project with Woodside's 13 percent nonoperated interest in the Wheatstone Project and 65 percent operated interest in the Julimar-Brunello fields and related infrastructure, which is expected to close in 2026, subject to customary closing conditions and regulations.",
            "entity_name": "CVX-Woodside NWS Wheatstone Asset Swap",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In early 2025, Chevron acquired an 80 percent-owned and operated interest in PEL82 (Blocks 2112B and 2212A) in the Walvis Basin.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Acquisition of Namibia PEL82",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "In 2024, Chevron acquired a 60 percent-owned and operated interest in offshore exploration Block OFF-1 with plans to initiate a 3D seismic campaign in 2025.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Acquisition of Uruguay Block OFF-1",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "All blocks in which Chevron has a participating interest are in the process of being relinquished to the government.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Mexico Block Relinquishments",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_1"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "During 2024, Chevron was formally awarded 26 exploration blocks as a result of Gulf of America lease sale 261.",
            "entity_name": "CVX Gulf of America Lease Sale 261 Block Awards",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": null,
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
